de la recherche d''informations","Compatibilité avec les assistants de codage IA"],"de":["Dokumentensuche in der Kommandozeile","Anpassbare Konfiguration mit `ccmds config`","Initialisierung der Konfiguration mit `ccmds init`","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Suche nach Informationen","Kompatibilität mit AI-Coding-Assistenten"],"pt":["Suporte à configuração personalizada via arquivo .ccmdsrc","Comando `ccmds config` para visualizar a configuração atual","Comando `ccmds init` para criar o arquivo .ccmdsrc","Busca eficiente de documentação sem a necessidade de ler arquivos diretamente","Suporte à busca de documentação para setup, configuração, instalação e API"],"ru":["Поддержка настраиваемой конфигурации через файл .ccmdsrc","Команда `ccmds config` для просмотра текущей конфигурации","Команда `ccmds init` для создания файла .ccmdsrc","Эффективный поиск документации без необходимости直接 читать файлы","Поддержка поиска документации для настройки, конфигурации, установки и API"],"ar":["دعم التكوين المخصص عبر ملف .ccmdsrc","الأمر `ccmds config` لعرض التكوين الحالي","الأمر `ccmds init` لإنشاء ملف .ccmdsrc","البحث الفعال عن المستندات دون الحاجة إلى قراءة الملفات مباشرة","دعم البحث عن المستندات لتثبيت، تكوين، إعداد وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ccmds","ccmds documentation search","ccmds setup guide","ccmds alternative","ccmds vs documentation search tools","installing ccmds","configuring ccmds","ccmds for AI coding assistants","efficient documentation search"],"zh":["ccmds","文档搜索","CLI","AI 编码助手","开发效率","配置文件","命令行工具"],"ja":["ccmds","ドキュメント検索","CLI","AI コーディング アシスタント","開発効率","設定ファイル","コマンドラインツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["ccmds","문서 검색","CLI","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","개발 효율성","설정 파일","명령줄 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["ccmds","asistentes de codificación AI","búsqueda de documentación","herramientas de línea de comandos","configuración de ccmds","mejora de la eficiencia","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["ccmds","assistants de codage IA","recherche de documentation","outils de ligne de commande","configuration de ccmds","amélioration de l''efficacité","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["ccmds","AI-Coding-Assistenten","Dokumentensuche","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Konfiguration von ccmds","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["ccmds","ferramenta de busca de documentação","assistente de codificação AI","linha de comando","configuração personalizada","busca eficiente de documentação","setup","configuração","instalação","API"],"ru":["ccmds","инструмент поиска документации","помощник кодирования ИИ Агенты","командная строка","настраиваемая конфигурация","эффективный поиск документации","настройка","конфигурация","установка","API"],"ar":["ccmds","أداة بحث المستندات","مساعد كتابة التعليمات البرمجية AI","سطر الأوامر","تكوين مخصص","البحث الفعال عن المستندات","إعداد","تكوين","تثبيت","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"bjeber","repo":"cc-md-search-cli","repoPath":"bjeber/cc-md-search-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.273Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ccmds","description":">","bodyPreview":"# ccmds - Documentation Search\n\n> Use this skill when user asks about documentation. More efficient than reading files directly.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- \"What do the docs say about...\"\n- \"Check the documentation\" / \"check the docs\"\n- \"How do I...\" (setup/config questions)\n- \"Find in documentation\" / \"search docs\"\n- Questions about setup, configuration, installation, API\n\n## First: Check Configuration\n\n```bash\nccmds config          # View current config\nccmds init            # Create .ccmdsrc if","body":"# ccmds - Documentation Search\n\n> Use this skill when user asks about documentation. More efficient than reading files directly.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- \"What do the docs say about...\"\n- \"Check the documentation\" / \"check the docs\"\n- \"How do I...\" (setup/config questions)\n- \"Find in documentation\" / \"search docs\"\n- Questions about setup, configuration, installation, API\n\n## First: Check Configuration\n\n```bash\nccmds config          # View current config\nccmds init            # Create .ccmdsrc if missing\n```\n\nWith a `.ccmdsrc` config file, commands use project defaults automatically.\n\n## Command Decision Guide\n\n| User Intent | Command | Why |\n|-------------|---------|-----|\n| Conceptual question, don''t know exact terms | `ccmds find \"query\"` | Fuzzy search |\n| Exact term, error code, pattern | `ccmds grep \"pattern\"` | Regex match |\n| Understand doc structure | `ccmds outline` | Headings only, minimal context |\n| Need specific section | `ccmds section file.md \"Heading\"` | Targeted extraction |\n| See what docs exist | `ccmds list` | File listing |\n| Read full file (after finding it) | `ccmds show file.md` | Full content |\n\n## Basic Syntax\n\n```bash\nccmds find \"authentication\"           # Fuzzy search\nccmds grep \"ERROR_[0-9]+\"             # Regex search\nccmds outline                         # Show structure\nccmds section ./docs/setup.md \"Install\"  # Extract section\nccmds list                            # List files\nccmds show ./docs/api.md              # Show file\n```\n\n## Output Modes\n\n| Mode | Use | Context |\n|------|-----|---------|\n| `json` | AI-optimized (default) | Compact |\n| `files` | Just need paths | Minimal |\n| `compact` | Human-readable snippets | Small |\n| `detailed` | Full context | Medium |\n\nDefault: `json`. Use `-o compact` for human-readable output.\n\n## Common Overrides\n\n```bash\nccmds find \"query\" -l 5              # Limit results\nccmds find \"query\" ./other/docs      # Different directory\nccmds find \"query\" --doc api         # Search only \"api\" docs\nccmds grep \"pattern\" -o files        # Files only output\nccmds list -e \"**/archive/**\"        # Exclude pattern\n```\n\n## Recommended Workflow\n\n1. `ccmds outline -d 2` - Understand structure (minimal context)\n2. `ccmds find \"topic\"` - Find relevant docs\n3. `ccmds section file.md \"Section\"` - Extract what you need\n\n---\n\n**For detailed documentation:**\n- [Command Reference](./ccmds-commands.md) - Full options for all commands\n- [Examples & Workflows](./ccmds-examples.md) - Common patterns and use cases\n- [Configuration](./ccmds-config.md) - Config file schema and patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:25.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Assistants seeking efficient documentation searches via CLI.","zh":"适合寻求通过CLI高效查找文档的编码助手。","ja":"CLIを介した効率的なドキュメント検索を求めるコーディングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"CLI를 통해 효율적인 문서 검색을 찾는 코딩 어시스턴트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación que buscan búsquedas de documentación eficientes a través de CLI.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage qui recherchent des recherches de documentation efficaces via CLI.","de":"Ideal für Coding-Assistenten, die effiziente Dokumentationssuchen über CLI suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação que procuram buscas de documentação eficientes via CLI.","ru":"Идеально для Кодирования Помощников, ищущих эффективные поиски документации через CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوسائط مساعدين التشفير الذين يبحثون عن عمليات بحث وثائق فعالة عبر CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly search documentation for setup, configuration, and API questions using the ccmds CLI, providing quick access to relevant information in .ccmdsrc configurations.","zh":"赋予代理人使用ccmds CLI快速搜索文档以获取设置、配置和API问题的答案，并在.ccmdsrc配置中提供对相关信息的快速访问。","ja":"エージェントにccmds CLIを使用してセットアップ、構成、API関連の質問に対する文書の迅速な検索を可能にし、.ccmdsrcの設定で関連情報への迅速なアクセスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 ccmds CLI를 사용하여 설정, 구성 및 API 관련 질문에 대한 문서를 빠르게 검색할 수 있도록 하며 .ccmdsrc 구성에서 관련 정보에 빠르게 액세스할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar rápidamente la documentación para la configuración, la instalación y las preguntas de API utilizando el CLI de ccmds, proporcionando un acceso rápido a la información relevante en configuraciones de .ccmdsrc.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher rapidement la documentation pour la configuration, l''installation et les questions d''API en utilisant le CLI de ccmds, fournissant un accès rapide aux informations pertinentes dans les configurations .ccmdsrc.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Dokumentation für die Einrichtung, Konfiguration und API-Fragen schnell über den ccmds-CLI zu suchen und so einen schnellen Zugriff auf relevante Informationen in .ccmdsrc-Konfigurationen zu erhalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes procurem rapidamente a documentação para configuração, instalação e perguntas de API usando o ccmds CLI, fornecendo acesso rápido às informações relevantes nas configurações .ccmdsrc.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро искать документацию для настройки, конфигурации и вопросов API с помощью ccmds CLI, обеспечивая быстрый доступ к соответствующей информации в конфигурациях .ccmdsrc.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية البحث السريع في الوثائق لإعدادات التثبيت والتهيئة واستفسارات API باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر ccmds، مما يوفر وصولًا سريعًا إلى المعلومات ذات الصلة في ملفات التهيئة .ccmdsrc."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching documentation for API setup","Configuring ccmds for efficient documentation lookup","Debugging installation issues via documentation search"],"zh":["搜索API设置的文档","配置ccmds以实现高效的文档查找","通过文档搜索调试安装问题"],"ja":["API設定のドキュメントを検索する","ドキュメントの効率的な検索のためのccmdsの構成","ドキュメント検索を介したインストールの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["API 설정에 대한 문서 검색","효율적인 문서 조회를 위한 ccmds 구성","문서 검색을 통해 설치 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Buscar documentación para la configuración de API","Configurar ccmds para una búsqueda de documentación eficiente","Depurar problemas de instalación a través de la búsqueda de documentación"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation pour la configuration d''API","Configurer ccmds pour une recherche de documentation efficace","Déboguer les problèmes d''installation via la recherche de documentation"],"de":["Dokumentation für API-Konfiguration suchen","ccmds für effiziente Dokumentationssuche konfigurieren","Installationsprobleme über Dokumentationssuche debuggen"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação para configuração de API","Configurar ccmds para busca de documentação eficiente","Depurar problemas de instalação via busca de documentação"],"ru":["Поиск документации для настройки API","Настройка ccmds для эффективного поиска документации","Отладка проблем установки через поиск документации"],"ar":["بحث الوثائق لإعدادات API","تهيئة ccmds للبحث الفعال في الوثائق","تصحيح مشاكل التثبيت من خلال بحث الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .ccmdsrc configuration file","CLI-based interaction only"],"zh":[".ccmdsrc配置文件是必需的","仅支持基于CLI的交互"],"ja":[".ccmdsrc設定ファイルが必要","CLIベースのインタラクションのみをサポート"],"ko":[".ccmdsrc 구성 파일이 필요","CLI 기반 상호 작용만 지원"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de configuración .ccmdsrc","Interacción basada solo en CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de configuration .ccmdsrc","Interaction basée uniquement sur CLI"],"de":["Benötigt eine .ccmdsrc-Konfigurationsdatei","Nur CLI-basierte Interaktion"],"pt":["Exige arquivo de configuração .ccmdsrc","Interação baseada apenas em CLI"],"ru":["Требует файла конфигурации .ccmdsrc","Только интеракция на основе CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف التهيئة .ccmdsrc","التفاعل القائم فقط على CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"52512042ee6a5c7aab01080dcb12cfb55b18d3817d3095ae6bd1987cb874443f","qualityScore":60}');
