"],"es":["gh-agent-session","Agentes de IA","Automatización de código","GitHub CLI","Sesiones de agente de GitHub","Instrucciones de lenguaje natural","Automatización de tareas","Desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["gh-agent-session","Outils d''IA","Automatisation de code","GitHub CLI","Sessions d''agent GitHub","Instructions en langage naturel","Automatisation de tâches","Développement de logiciels","Outils de développement"],"de":["gh-agent-session","KI-Agenten","Codeautomatisierung","GitHub CLI","GitHub-Agent-Sitzungen","Natürliche Sprachanweisungen","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["gh-agent-session","GitHub Copilot","GitHub CLI","Agentic Workflows","Linguagem natural","Alterações de código","Integração com GitHub","Repositório GitHub","Workflows de agentic"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","GitHub Copilot","GitHub CLI","Рабочие процессы агентов","Естественный язык","Изменения кода","Интеграция с GitHub","Репозиторий GitHub","ИИ инструменты"],"ar":["غ-عامل-جلسة","غيت هاب كوبيلوت","غيت هاب سي ال آي","تدفقات عمل إيجنت","لغة طبيعية","تعديلات الكود","التكامل مع غيت هاب","مستودع غيت هاب","أدوات إيجنت"]}},"owner":"github","repo":"gh-aw","repoPath":"github/gh-aw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-agent-session","description":"GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot coding agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trig","body":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot coding agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trigger GitHub Copilot to autonomously execute the task\n- Create pull requests with the implemented changes\n- Provide a workflow for reviewing and merging automated code modifications\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall via GitHub CLI:\n\n```bash\ngh extension install github/agent-task\n```\n\n**Note**: This extension requires authentication with a Personal Access Token (PAT) that has appropriate permissions for creating issues and pull requests.\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Create Agent Task\n\nCreate a new agent session from a description:\n\n```bash\n# Create task with inline description\ngh agent-task create \"Fix the bug in authentication flow\"\n\n# Create task from file\ngh agent-task create --from-file task-description.md\n\n# Specify base branch\ngh agent-task create --base develop \"Implement new feature\"\n\n# Create in different repository\ngh agent-task create --repo owner/repo \"Update documentation\"\n```\n\n**Command Parameters:**\n- **Description** (positional): Natural language description of the task\n- **`--from-file <path>`**: Read task description from file\n- **`--base <branch>`**: Base branch for the pull request (default: repository default branch)\n- **`--repo <owner/repo>`**: Target repository (default: current repository)\n\n**Output Format:**\nThe command outputs the URL of the created agent session:\n```\nhttps://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### List Agent Tasks\n\nList agent sessions in a repository:\n\n```bash\n# List all agent sessions\ngh agent-task list\n\n# List with filters\ngh agent-task list --state open\ngh agent-task list --state closed\ngh agent-task list --state all\n```\n\n### View Agent Task\n\nView details of a specific agent session:\n\n```bash\n# View by number\ngh agent-task view 123\n\n# View by URL\ngh agent-task view https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### Update Agent Task\n\nUpdate an existing agent session:\n\n```bash\n# Update description\ngh agent-task update 123 \"Updated task description\"\n\n# Update from file\ngh agent-task update 123 --from-file updated-description.md\n```\n\n## Task Description Format\n\nAgent session descriptions should be clear, specific natural language instructions:\n\n**Good Example:**\n```markdown\n# Refactor User Authentication\n\nRefactor the user authentication flow in `src/auth/login.js` to:\n1. Use async/await instead of callbacks\n2. Add proper error handling with specific error messages\n3. Add input validation for email format\n4. Update tests to cover the new implementation\n\nMaintain backward compatibility with the existing API.\n```\n\n**Poor Example:**\n```markdown\nFix auth\n```\n\n**Best Practices:**\n- Be specific about what needs to change\n- Reference file paths when relevant\n- Include acceptance criteria\n- Specify any constraints or requirements\n- Mention testing expectations\n\n## Integration with GitHub Agentic Workflows\n\nThe `gh agent-task` extension is used by the `create-agent-session` safe output feature in GitHub Agentic Workflows (gh-aw).\n\n### Safe Output Configuration\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main                       # Base branch for agent session PR\n    target-repo: \"owner/target-repo\" # Cross-repository task creation\n```\n\n### Workflow Example\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  actions: read\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main\n\n# Code Task Delegator\n\nWhen an issue is labeled with \"code-task\", analyze the requirements and create a GitHub Copilot coding agent session with detailed instructions for implementing the requested changes.\n```\n\n### Implementation Details\n\nThe safe output processor:\n1. Reads agent output from the workflow execution\n2. Extracts `create_agent_task` items from the structured output\n3. Writes task descriptions to temporary files\n4. Executes `gh agent-task create --from-file <file> --base <branch>`\n5. Captures the created task URL and number\n6. Reports results in job summary\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `GITHUB_AW_AGENT_TASK_BASE`: Base branch for the pull request\n- `GITHUB_AW_TARGET_REPO`: Target repository for cross-repo task creation\n- `GITHUB_AW_SAFE_OUTPUTS_STAGED`: Preview mode flag\n\n## Authentication Requirements\n\nAgent session creation requires elevated permissions beyond the default `GITHUB_TOKEN`:\n\n**Required Permissions:**\n- `contents: write` - To create branches and commits\n- `issues: write` - To create the agent session issue\n- `pull-requests: write` - To create pull requests\n\n**Token Precedence:**\n1. `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` - Dedicated Copilot operations token (recommended)\n2. `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` - General override token (legacy)\n3. Custom token via `github-token` configuration field\n\n**Note**: The default `GITHUB_TOKEN` is **not** supported as it lacks required permissions. The `COPILOT_CLI_TOKEN` and `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` secrets are no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n\n### Setting Up Authentication\n\nStore your Personal Access Token in repository secrets:\n\n```bash\n# In your repository settings, add secret:\n# Name: COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN (recommended)\n# Value: ghp_YourPersonalAccessToken\n```\n\n:::note[Backward Compatibility]\nLegacy token name `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` is still supported for backward compatibility. The `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` token is no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n:::\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Authentication Errors\n\n```\nError: failed to create agent session\nauthentication required\n```\n\n**Solution**: Configure `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` or legacy `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` with a PAT.\n\n### Permission Errors\n\n```\nError: 403 Forbidden\nResource not accessible by integration\n```\n\n**Solution**: Ensure the token has `contents: write`, `issues: write`, and `pull-requests: write` permissions.\n\n### Repository Not Found\n\n```\nError: repository not found\n```\n\n**Solution**: Verify the target repository exists and the token has access to it.\n\n## Testing in Staged Mode\n\nWhen `safe-outputs.staged: true`, agent sessions are previewed without creation:\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  staged: true\n  create-agent-session:\n```\n\n**Staged Output:**\n```markdown\n## 🎭 Staged Mode: Create Agent Tasks Preview\n\nThe following agent sessions would be created if staged mode was disabled:\n\n### Task 1\n\n**Description:**\nRefactor authentication to use async/await pattern\n\n**Base Branch:** main\n\n**Target Repository:** owner/repo\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Issue-Triggered Agent Tasks\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n\nWhen issue is labeled with \"needs-implementation\", create an agent session with implementation instructions.\n```\n\n### Scheduled Code Improvements\n\n```yaml\non:\n  schedule:\n    - cron: \"0 9 * * 1\"  # Monday 9AM\nengine: copilot\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: develop\n\nAnalyze codebase for improvement opportunities and create agent sessions for top 3 improvements.\n```\n\n### Cross-Repository Task Delegation\n\n```yaml\non: workflow_dispatch\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    target-repo: \"organization/backend-repo\"\n    base: main\n\nCreate agent session in backend repository to implement the API changes described in this issue.\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Task Description Guidelines\n\n1. **Be Specific**: Include file paths, function names, and exact requirements\n2. **Include Context**: Explain why the change is needed\n3. **Define Success**: Specify acceptance criteria or expected outcomes\n4. **Mention Tests**: Request test coverage for changes\n5. **Set Constraints**: Note any compatibility requirements or limitations\n\n### Security Considerations\n\n1. **Token Security**: Store PATs as secrets, never commit to repository\n2. **Permission Scope**: Use minimum required permissions on tokens\n3. **Repository Access**: Validate target repository before task creation\n4. **Review Process**: Establish review workflow for agent-generated code\n\n### Operational Guidelines\n\n1. **Monitor Usage**: Track agent session creation and completion rates\n2. **Review Output**: Always review agent-generated pull requests\n3. **Iterate**: Refine task descriptions based on agent performance\n4. **Document**: Maintain patterns for common task types\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Task Creation Fails Silently\n\n**Symptom**: No error but no task created\n\n**Check**:\n1. Verify `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` is set in repository secrets\n2. Confirm token has required permissions\n3. Check job logs for error messages\n4. Verify target repository exists and is accessible\n\n### Agent Task Not Triggering Copilot\n\n**Symptom**: Task created but no automated PR\n\n**Possible Causes**:\n1. GitHub Copilot not enabled for repository\n2. Task description unclear or ambiguous\n3. Repository settings blocking automated PRs\n4. Copilot service issues\n\n**Solution**: Check repository Copilot settings and refine task description.\n\n### Cross-Repository Tasks Fail\n\n**Symptom**: Error when creating tasks in different repository\n\n**Check**:\n1. Token has access to target repository\n2. Target repository exists and is spelled correctly\n3. Token has required permissions in target repository\n\n## Output Structure\n\nWhen used via safe outputs, the create-agent-session job provides outputs:\n\n```yaml\noutputs:\n  task_number: \"123\"\n  task_url: \"https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\"\n```\n\n**Usage in Dependent Jobs:**\n```yaml\njobs:\n  follow_up:\n    needs: create_agent_task\n    steps:\n      - name: Notify team\n        run: |\n          echo \"Agent session created: ${{ needs.create_agent_task.outputs.task_url }}\"\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub Copilot Documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot)\n- [GitHub CLI Extensions](https://docs.github.com/en/github-cli/github-cli/using-github-cli-extensions)\n- [Safe Outputs Documentation](https://github.github.com/gh-aw/reference/safe-outputs/)\n- [Personal Access Tokens](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/creating-a-personal-access-token)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:33.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Agents requiring automated code changes through natural language instructions via GitHub Copilot","zh":"适合需要通过自然语言指令自动进行代码更改的编码代理，特别是通过 GitHub Copilot","ja":"GitHub Copilot を介した自然言語指示による自動コード変更を必要とするコーディングエージェントに最適","ko":"자연어 지시를 통해 자동 코드 변경이 필요한 코딩 에이전트에게 적합하며, GitHub Copilot을 통해 제공됩니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación que requieren cambios de código automatizados a través de instrucciones de lenguaje natural a través de GitHub Copilot","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage nécessitant des modifications de code automatisées via des instructions de langage naturel via GitHub Copilot","de":"Ideal für Coding-Agents, die automatisierte Codeänderungen durch natürliche Sprachanweisungen über GitHub Copilot erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação que requerem alterações de código automatizadas por meio de instruções de linguagem natural via GitHub Copilot","ru":"Идеально для Кодировочных Агентов, требующих автоматических изменений кода через естественные языковые инструкции через GitHub Copilot","ar":"مثالي لعميل التشفير الذي يتطلب تغييرات код آلية من خلال تعليمات لغة طبيعية من خلال GitHub Copilot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger automated code changes based on natural language instructions through GitHub Copilot coding agent sessions, utilizing the GitHub CLI and natural language processing for seamless integration with GitHub repositories and issues","zh":"赋予代理触发自动代码更改的能力，基于自然语言指示，通过 GitHub Copilot 编码代理会话，利用 GitHub CLI 和自然语言处理实现与 GitHub 存储库和问题的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントが自然言語指示に基づいて自動コード変更をトリガーできるようにし、GitHub Copilot コーディングエージェントセッションを介して GitHub CLI と自然言語処理を利用し、GitHub リポジトリと問題とのシームレスな統合を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 지시를 기반으로 자동 코드 변경을 트리거할 수 있도록 해주며, GitHub Copilot 코딩 에이전트 세션을 통해 GitHub CLI와 자연어 처리를 사용하여 GitHub 리포지토리 및 문제와의無縫な統合을 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desencadenar cambios de código automatizados en función de instrucciones de lenguaje natural a través de sesiones de agentes de codificación de GitHub Copilot, utilizando GitHub CLI y procesamiento de lenguaje natural para una integración perfecta con los repositorios y problemas de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des modifications de code automatisées en fonction d''instructions de langage naturel via des sessions d''agents de codage GitHub Copilot, en utilisant GitHub CLI et le traitement du langage naturel pour une intégration transparente avec les référentiels et les problèmes GitHub","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Codeänderungen auf der Grundlage von natürlichen Sprachanweisungen über GitHub Copilot-Coding-Agentsitzungen auszulösen, wobei die GitHub-CLI und die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache für eine nahtlose Integration mit GitHub-Repositorys und -Problemen verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a disparar alterações de código automatizadas com base em instruções de linguagem natural por meio de sessões de agentes de codificação do GitHub Copilot, utilizando o GitHub CLI e processamento de linguagem natural para integração perfeita com repositórios e problemas do GitHub","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать автоматические изменения кода на основе естественных языковых инструкций через сеансы кодировочных агентов GitHub Copilot, используя GitHub CLI и обработку естественного языка для бесшовной интеграции с репозиториями и проблемами GitHub","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل التغييرات الآلية للرمز بناءً على تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية من خلال جلسات وكلاء التشفير من GitHub Copilot، باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub والمعالجة اللغوية الطبيعية من أجل التكامل السلس مع مستودعات GitHub والقضايا"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code refactorings through natural language instructions","Generating pull requests based on issue descriptions","Debugging code issues reported in GitHub issues"],"zh":["通过自然语言指令自动执行代码重构","根据问题描述生成拉取请求","调试在 GitHub 问题中报告的代码问题"],"ja":["自然言語指示による自動コードリファクタリング","問題の説明に基づいてプルリクエストを生成する","GitHub の問題で報告されたコードの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["자연어 지시를 통해 자동 코드 리팩터링 수행","문제 설명을 기반으로 풀 リクエスト 생성","GitHub 문제에서 보고된 코드 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de refactorizaciones de código a través de instrucciones de lenguaje natural","Generación de solicitudes de extracción basadas en descripciones de problemas","Depuración de problemas de código informados en problemas de GitHub"],"fr":["Automatisation des refactorisations de code via des instructions de langage naturel","Génération de demandes d''extraction basées sur les descriptions de problèmes","Débogage des problèmes de code signalés dans les problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Refactorings durch natürliche Sprachanweisungen","Generierung von Pull-Requests basierend auf Problembeschreibungen","Fehlerbehebung von Codeproblemen, die in GitHub-Problemen gemeldet werden"],"pt":["Automatizar refactorizações de código por meio de instruções de linguagem natural","Gerar solicitações de pull com base em descrições de problemas","Depurar problemas de código relatados em problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рефакторинг кода на основе естественных языковых инструкций","Генерировать запросы на включение на основе описаний проблем","Отлаживать проблемы кода, сообщенные в проблемах GitHub"],"ar":["تأتمتة إعادة هيكلة الرمز من خلال تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية","إنش