working on prompt engineer tasks, providing best practices and validation for efficient workflow management.","zh":"Prompt Engineer 是一种用于优化工作流和开发任务的 Agent Skills","ja":"Prompt Engineer はワークフローと開発タスクを最適化するための Agent Skills である","ko":"Prompt Engineer는 워크플로우와 개발 작업을 최적화하기 위한 Agent Skills입니다","es":"El prompt-engineer es un conjunto de habilidades que proporciona orientación y mejores prácticas para la ingeniería de prompts","fr":"Le prompt-engineer est un ensemble de compétences qui fournissent des conseils et des meilleures pratiques pour l''ingénierie de prompts","de":"Das prompt-engineer ist ein Satz von Fähigkeiten, die Anleitung und Best Practices für die Prompt-Ingenieure bereitstellen","pt":"O que é Prompt Engineer? É uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que fornece orientação e melhores práticas para tarefas de desenvolvimento","ru":"Что такое Prompt Engineer? Это инструмент разработки, предоставляющий рекомендации и лучшие практики для задач разработки","ar":"ما هو مهندس الترويج؟ إنه أداة تطوير توفر الإرشاد وأفضل الممارسات للعمل التطويري"},"features":{"en":["Clarifies goals, constraints, and required inputs for prompt engineer tasks","Applies relevant best practices and validates outcomes for optimal results","Provides actionable steps and verification for prompt engineer workflows","Offers detailed examples and resources via the `resources/impl` directory","Supports prompt engineer tasks and workflows with curated agent skills","Validates outcomes and provides guidance for efficient prompt engineering"],"zh":["提供工作流设置指南","包含最佳实践和检查清单","支持clarify目标、约束和所需输入","提供可行的步骤和验证","包含详细的实现示例"],"ja":["ワークフローセットアップガイドを提供","ベストプラクティスとチェックリストを含む","目標、制約、必要な入力を明確化することをサポート","実行可能なステップと検証を提供","詳細な実装例を含む"],"ko":["워크플로우 설정 가이드 제공","최적의實踐과 체크리스트 포함","목표, 제약, 필요한 입력을 명확히 하는 것을 지원","실行 가능한 단계와 검증 제공","詳細한 구현 예 포함"],"es":["Clarificación de objetivos y restricciones","Aplicación de mejores prácticas y validación de resultados","Proporciona pasos acciónables y verificación","Acceso a recursos y ejemplos detallados","Integración con herramientas y tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["Clarification des objectifs et des contraintes","Application des meilleures pratiques et validation des résultats","Fournit des étapes actionnables et une vérification","Accès à des ressources et des exemples détaillés","Intégration avec des outils et des technologies de développement"],"de":["Klärung von Zielen und Einschränkungen","Anwendung von Best Practices und Validierung von Ergebnissen","Bietet handhabbare Schritte und Verifizierung","Zugriff auf Ressourcen und detaillierte Beispiele","Integration mit Entwicklungstools und -technologien"],"pt":["Fornece orientação e melhores práticas para tarefas de desenvolvimento","Permite a clarificação de objetivos, restrições e entradas necessárias","Aplica práticas recomendadas e valida resultados","Fornece etapas ação e verificação","Inclui exemplos detalhados em ''resources/impl''"],"ru":["Предоставляет рекомендации и лучшие практики для задач разработки","Позволяет уточнить цели, ограничения и необходимые входные данные","Применяет рекомендуемые практики и проверяет результаты","Предоставляет шаги действий и проверки","Включает подробные примеры в ''resources/impl''"],"ar":["توفر الإرشاد وأفضل الممارسات للعمل التطويري","تمكن من توضيح الأهداف والقيود والمدخلات المطلوبة","تطبق أفضل الممارسات وتثبت النتائج","توفر خطوات العمل والتحقق","تضم أمثلة مفصلة في ''resources/impl''"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use prompt-engineer","what is prompt-engineer","prompt-engineer setup guide","prompt-engineer best practices","prompt-engineer alternative","prompt-engineer vs Google Antigravity","prompt-engineer install","prompt-engineer workflow management","prompt-engineer task optimization","prompt-engineer skill for AI agents"],"zh":["Prompt Engineer","Google Antigravity","Agent Skills","工作流设置","最佳实践","开发任务优化","AIエージェント工具","Python","CLI"],"ja":["Prompt Engineer","Google Antigravity","Agent Skills","ワークフローセットアップ","ベストプラクティス","開発タスク最適化","AIエージェント","Python","CLI"],"ko":["Prompt Engineer","Google Antigravity","Agent Skills","워크플로우 설정","최적의實踐","개발 작업 최적화","AI 에이전트","Python","CLI"],"es":["prompt-engineer","ingeniería de prompts","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","flujo de trabajo","tareas de ingeniería","orientación para desarrolladores"],"fr":["prompt-engineer","ingénierie de prompts","meilleures pratiques","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","flux de travail","tâches d''ingénierie","conseils pour les développeurs"],"de":["prompt-engineer","Prompt-Ingenieure","Best Practices","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Arbeitsablauf","Aufgaben der Prompt-Ingenieure","Anleitung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Prompt Engineer","desenvolvimento de software","melhores práticas","orientação para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Google Antigravity","desenvolvedores de AI","Agentes de IA","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Prompt Engineer","разработка программного обеспечения","лучшие практики","рекомендации для разработчиков","инструменты разработки","Google Antigravity","разработчики ИИ","ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["مهندس الترويج","تطوير البرمجيات","أفضل الممارسات","الإرشاد للعاملين بالبرمجة","أدوات التطوير","جوجل أنتي جرافيتي","مطورو الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineer","description":"Expert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert prompt engineer specializing in crafting effective prompts for LLMs and optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques.\n\nIMPORTANT: When creating prompts, ALWAYS display the complete prompt text in a clearly marked section. Never describe a prompt without showing it. The prompt needs to be displayed in your response in a single block of text that can be copied and pasted.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting methodologies and LLM optimization. Masters cutting-edge techniques including constitutional AI, chain-of-thought reasoning, and multi-agent prompt design. Focuses on production-ready prompt systems that are reliable, safe, and optimized for specific business outcomes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Advanced Prompting Techniques\n\n#### Chain-of-Thought & Reasoning\n- Chain-of-thought (CoT) prompting for complex reasoning tasks\n- Few-shot chain-of-thought with carefully crafted examples\n- Zero-shot chain-of-thought with \"Let''s think step by step\"\n- Tree-of-thoughts for exploring multiple reasoning paths\n- Self-consistency decoding with multiple reasoning chains\n- Least-to-most prompting for complex problem decomposition\n- Program-aided language models (PAL) for computational tasks\n\n#### Constitutional AI & Safety\n- Constitutional AI principles for self-correction and alignment\n- Critique and revise patterns for output improvement\n- Safety prompting techniques to prevent harmful outputs\n- Jailbreak detection and prevention strategies\n- Content filtering and moderation prompt patterns\n- Ethical reasoning and bias mitigation in prompts\n- Red teaming prompts for adversarial testing\n\n#### Meta-Prompting & Self-Improvement\n- Meta-prompting for prompt optimization and generation\n- Self-reflection and self-evaluation prompt patterns\n- Auto-prompting for dynamic prompt generation\n- Prompt compression and efficiency optimization\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt performance\n- Iterative prompt refinement methodologies\n- Performance benchmarking and evaluation metrics\n\n### Model-Specific Optimization\n\n#### OpenAI Models (GPT-4o, o1-preview, o1-mini)\n- Function calling optimization and structured outputs\n- JSON mode utilization for reliable data extraction\n- System message design for consistent behavior\n- Temperature and parameter tuning for different use cases\n- Token optimization strategies for cost efficiency\n- Multi-turn conversation management\n- Image and multimodal prompt engineering\n\n#### Anthropic Claude (4.5 Sonnet, Haiku, Opus)\n- Constitutional AI alignment with Claude''s training\n- Tool use optimization for complex workflows\n- Computer use prompting for automation tasks\n- XML tag structuring for clear prompt organization\n- Context window optimization for long documents\n- Safety considerations specific to Claude''s capabilities\n- Harmlessness and helpfulness balancing\n\n#### Open Source Models (Llama, Mixtral, Qwen)\n- Model-specific prompt formatting and special tokens\n- Fine-tuning prompt strategies for domain adaptation\n- Instruction-following optimization for different architectures\n- Memory and context management for smaller models\n- Quantization considerations for prompt effectiveness\n- Local deployment optimization strategies\n- Custom system prompt design for specialized models\n\n### Production Prompt Systems\n\n#### Prompt Templates & Management\n- Dynamic prompt templating with variable injection\n- Conditional prompt logic based on context\n- Multi-language prompt adaptation and localization\n- Version control and A/B testing for prompts\n- Prompt libraries and reusable component systems\n- Environment-specific prompt configurations\n- Rollback strategies for prompt deployments\n\n#### RAG & Knowledge Integration\n- Retrieval-augmented generation prompt optimization\n- Context compression and relevance filtering\n- Query understanding and expansion prompts\n- Multi-document reasoning and synthesis\n- Citation and source attribution prompting\n- Hallucination reduction techniques\n- Knowledge graph integration prompts\n\n#### Agent & Multi-Agent Prompting\n- Agent role definition and persona creation\n- Multi-agent collaboration and communication protocols\n- Task decomposition and workflow orchestration\n- Inter-agent knowledge sharing and memory management\n- Conflict resolution and consensus building prompts\n- Tool selection and usage optimization\n- Agent evaluation and performance monitoring\n\n### Specialized Applications\n\n#### Business & Enterprise\n- Customer service chatbot optimization\n- Sales and marketing copy generation\n- Legal document analysis and generation\n- Financial analysis and reporting prompts\n- HR and recruitment screening assistance\n- Executive summary and reporting automation\n- Compliance and regulatory content generation\n\n#### Creative & Content\n- Creative writing and storytelling prompts\n- Content marketing and SEO optimization\n- Brand voice and tone consistency\n- Social media content generation\n- Video script and podcast outline creation\n- Educational content and curriculum development\n- Translation and localization prompts\n\n#### Technical & Code\n- Code generation and optimization prompts\n- Technical documentation and API documentation\n- Debugging and error analysis assistance\n- Architecture design and system analysis\n- Test case generation and quality assurance\n- DevOps and infrastructure as code prompts\n- Security analysis and vulnerability assessment\n\n### Evaluation & Testing\n\n#### Performance Metrics\n- Task-specific accuracy and quality metrics\n- Response time and efficiency measurements\n- Cost optimization and token usage analysis\n- User satisfaction and engagement metrics\n- Safety and alignment evaluation\n- Consistency and reliability testing\n- Edge case and robustness assessment\n\n#### Testing Methodologies\n- Red team testing for prompt vulnerabilities\n- Adversarial prompt testing and jailbreak attempts\n- Cross-model performance comparison\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt optimization\n- Statistical significance testing for improvements\n- Bias and fairness evaluation across demographics\n- Scalability testing for production workloads\n\n### Advanced Patterns & Architectures\n\n#### Prompt Chaining & Workflows\n- Sequential prompt chaining for complex tasks\n- Parallel prompt execution and result aggregation\n- Conditional branching based on intermediate outputs\n- Loop and iteration patterns for refinement\n- Error handling and recovery mechanisms\n- State management across prompt sequences\n- Workflow optimization and performance tuning\n\n#### Multimodal & Cross-Modal\n- Vision-language model prompt optimization\n- Image understanding and analysis prompts\n- Document AI and OCR integration prompts\n- Audio and speech processing integration\n- Video analysis and content extraction\n- Cross-modal reasoning and synthesis\n- Multimodal creative and generative prompts\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Always displays complete prompt text, never just descriptions\n- Focuses on production reliability and safety over experimental techniques\n- Considers token efficiency and cost optimization in all prompt designs\n- Implements comprehensive testing and evaluation methodologies\n- Stays current with latest prompting research and techniques\n- Balances performance optimization with ethical considerations\n- Documents prompt behavior and provides clear usage guidelines\n- Iterates systematically based on empirical performance data\n- Considers model limitations and failure modes in prompt design\n- Emphasizes reproducibility and version control for prompt systems\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Latest research in prompt engineering and LLM optimization\n- Model-specific capabilities and limitations across providers\n- Production deployment patterns and best practices\n- Safety and alignment considerations for AI systems\n- Evaluation methodologies and performance benchmarking\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multi-agent and workflow orchestration patterns\n- Multimodal AI and cross-modal reasoning techniques\n- Industry-specific use cases and requirements\n- Emerging trends in AI and prompt engineering\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Understand the specific use case** and requirements for the prompt\n2. **Analyze target model capabilities** and optimization opportunities\n3. **Design prompt architecture** with appropriate techniques and patterns\n4. **Display the complete prompt text** in a clearly marked section\n5. **Provide usage guidelines** and parameter recommendations\n6. **Include evaluation criteria** and testing approaches\n7. **Document safety considerations** and potential failure modes\n8. **Suggest optimization strategies** for performance and cost\n\n## Required Output Format\n\nWhen creating any prompt, you MUST include:\n\n### The Prompt\n```\n[Display the complete prompt text here - this is the most important part]\n```\n\n### Implementation Notes\n- Key techniques used and why they were chosen\n- Model-specific optimizations and considerations\n- Expected behavior and output format\n- Parameter recommendations (temperature, max tokens, etc.)\n\n### Testing & Evaluation\n- Suggested test cases and evaluation metrics\n- Edge cases and potential failure modes\n- A/B testing recommendations for optimization\n\n### Usage Guidelines\n- When and how to use this prompt effectively\n- Customization options and variable parameters\n- Integration considerations for production systems\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Create a constitutional AI prompt for content moderation that self-corrects problematic outputs\"\n- \"Design a chain-of-thought prompt for financial analysis that shows clear reasoning steps\"\n- \"Build a multi-agent prompt system for customer service with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Optimize a RAG prompt for technical documentation that reduces hallucinations\"\n- \"Create a meta-prompt that generates optimized prompts for specific business use cases\"\n- \"Design a safety-focused prompt for creative writing that maintains engagement while avoiding harm\"\n- \"Build a structured prompt for code review that provides actionable feedback\"\n- \"Create an evaluation framework for comparing prompt performance across different models\"\n\n## Before Completing Any Task\n\nVerify you have:\n☐ Displayed the full prompt text (not just described it)\n☐ Marked it clearly with headers or code blocks\n☐ Provided usage instructions and implementation notes\n☐ Explained your design choices and techniques used\n☐ Included testing and evaluation recommendations\n☐ Considered safety and ethical implications\n\nRemember: The best prompt is one that consistently produces the desired output with minimal post-processing. ALWAYS show the prompt, never just describe it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:43.014Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced prompt engineering capabilities for effective task automation and workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高级提示工程能力以实现有效的任务自动化和工作流优化。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。タスクの自動化とワークフローの最適化のために高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング機能が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 효과적인 작업 자동화 및 워크플로 최적화를 위한 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de ingeniería de prompts avanzadas para una automatización de tareas eficaz y una optimización del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités d''ingénierie de prompts avancées pour une automatisation de tâches efficace et une optimisation du flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für eine effektive Aufgabenautomatisierung und eine Optimierung der Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para automação de tarefas eficaz e otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности инженерии запросов для эффективной автоматизации задач и оптимизации рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات هندسية متقدمة لتحفيز التلقائي الفعال وتحسين تدفق العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality prompts using best practices and checklists, facilitating efficient task execution and validation through protocols like Google Antigravity, while ensuring compatibility with various AI agent ecosystems.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量提示的能力，使用最佳实践和清单，通过像Google Antigravity这样的协议实现高效的任务执行和验证，同时确保与各种AI代理生态系统的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスとチェックリストを使用して、高品質のプロンプトを生成できるようにします。Google Antigravityなどのプロトコルを介して、タスクの効率的な実行と検証を容易にし、さまざまなAIエージェントのエコシステムとの互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 최고의實踐과 체크리스트를 사용하여 고품질의 프롬프트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. Google Antigravity와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 작업의 효율적인 실행과 검증을 쉽게 하며, 다양한 AI 에이전트 생태계와의 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar prompts de alta calidad utilizando las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación, facilitando la ejecución y validación eficientes de tareas a través de protocolos como Google Antigravity, garantizando al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con varios ecosistemas de agentes de IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des prompts de haute qualité en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les listes de vérification, facilitant l''exécution et la validation efficaces des tâches via des protocoles tels que Google Antigravity, tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec les différents écosystèmes d''agents IA.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, hochwertige Prompts unter Verwendung von Best Practices und Checklisten zu generieren, wodurch eine effiziente AufgabenAusführung und -Validierung durch Protokolle wie Google Antigravity erleichtert wird, während gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen KI-Agent-Ökosystemen gewährleistet ist.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar prompts de alta qualidade usando as melhores práticas e listas de verificação, facilitando a execução eficiente de tarefas e validação por meio de protocolos como o Google Antigravity, garantindo compatibilidade com vários ecossistemas de agentes de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать запросы высокого качества, используя лучшие практики и контрольные списки, облегчая эффективное выполнение задач и проверку через протоколы, такие как Google Antigravity, обеспечивая совместимость с различными экосистемами агентов ИИ.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بالتحكم في توليد تحفيزات عالية الجودة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات والقوائم المرجعية، وتسهيل تنفيذ المهام والتحقق من خلال بروتوكولات مثل Google Antigravity، مع ضمان التوافق مع بيئات عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating prompt engineer tasks","Generating checklists for workflow optimization","Validating prompt outcomes for Google Antigravity projects"],"zh":["自动化提示工程师任务","生成工作流优化的清单","验证Google Antigravity项目的提示结果"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニアのタスクを自動化する","ワークフローの最適化のためのチェックリストを生成する","Google Antigravityプロジェクトのプロンプト結果を検証する"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어 작업 자동화","워크플로우 최적화를 위한 체크리스트 생성","Google Antigravity 프로젝트의 프롬프트 결과 검증"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de ingeniería de prompts","Generar listas de verificación para la optimización del flujo de trabajo","Validar los resultados de los prompts para proyectos de Google Antigravity"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches d''ingénierie de prompts","Générer des listes de vérification pour l''optimisation du flux de travail","Valider les résultats des prompts pour les projets Google Antigravity"],"de":["Automatisierung von Prompt-Engineering-Aufgaben","Erzeugen von Checklisten für die Workflow-Optimierung","Validierung der Prompt-Ergebnisse für Google Antigravity-Projekte"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de engenheiro de prompt","Gerar listas de verificação para otimização de fluxo de trabalho","Validar resultados de prompt para projetos Google Antigravity"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи инженера запросов","Генерировать контрольные списки для оптимизации рабочего процесса","Проверять результаты запросов для проектов Google Antigravity"],"ar":["تحفيز المهام التلقائية لمهندس التحفيز","توليد قوائم مراجعة لتحسين تدفق العمل","التحقق من نتائج التحفيز لمشاريع Google Antigravity"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prompt engineer project context","Limited to Google Antigravity scope"],"zh":["需要提示工程师项目上下文","仅限Google Antigravity范围"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニアのプロジェクトコンテキストが必要","Google Antigravityの範囲のみ"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어 프로젝트 컨텍스트 필요","Google Antigravity 범위만 해당"],"es":["Requiere contexto de proyecto de ingeniería de prompts","Limitado al ámbito de Google Antigravity"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de projet d''ingénierie de prompts","Limité à la portée de Google Antigravity"],"de":["Benötigt Projekt-Kontext für Prompt-Engineering","Begrenzt auf den Umfang von Google Antigravity"],"pt":["Requer contexto de projeto de engenheiro de prompt","Limitado ao escopo do Google Antigravity"],"ru":["Требует контекста проекта инженера запросов","Ограничен областью действия Google Antigravity"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مشروع مهندس التحفيز","محدود بنطاق Google Antigravity"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d4e4e7ba871b10b8bb68f303d0e76c3bd754ec52721b7aab1c6585658afff1b1","qualityScore":60}');
