ome Ausführung zu ermöglichen","pt":"Ralph é uma ferramenta de automação de workflows que converte PRDs para o formato prd.json para execução autônoma","ru":"Ralph - это инструмент для автономной разработки приложений, который преобразует PRD в формат prd.json для автономного выполнения","ar":"Ralph هو أداة لتحسين العمليات التشغيلية التي تقوم بتحويل PRD إلى تنسيق prd.json للتشغيل الآلي"},"features":{"en":["Converts existing PRDs to prd.json format","Supports autonomous execution using Claude Code","Generates project structure with branchName and description","Creates userStories in prd.json with id, title, and description","Takes markdown files or text as input for PRD conversion","Outputs prd.json in the ralph directory"],"zh":["自动化工作流","PRD 转换为 JSON 格式","支持 Claude Code","自动化构建应用程序","支持 Markdown 文件和文本输入","输出 JSON 格式的项目信息"],"ja":["自動化ワークフロー","PRD を JSON フォーマットに変換","Claude Code をサポート","アプリケーションの自動構築","Markdown ファイルとテキスト入力をサポート","JSON フォーマットのプロジェクト情報を出力"],"ko":["자동화 워크플로우","PRD 를 JSON 형식으로 변환","Claude Code 를 지원","애플리케이션 자동 빌드","Markdown 파일과 텍스트 입력을 지원","JSON 형식의 프로젝트 정보를 출력"],"es":["Conversión de PRDs a formato prd.json","Ejecución autónoma con Claude Code","Compatibilidad con archivos markdown y texto","Generación de archivos prd.json en el directorio de Ralph","Soporte para la creación de historias de usuario","Integración con flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Conversion de PRDs au format prd.json","Exécution autonome avec Claude Code","Compatibilité avec les fichiers markdown et texte","Génération de fichiers prd.json dans le répertoire de Ralph","Prise en charge de la création d''histoires utilisateur","Intégration avec les flux de travail automatisés"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRDs in das prd.json-Format","Autonome Ausführung mit Claude Code","Kompatibilität mit Markdown- und Textdateien","Erzeugung von prd.json-Dateien im Ralph-Verzeichnis","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von Benutzerstories","Integration mit automatisierten Workflows"],"pt":["Conversão de PRDs para o formato prd.json","Execução autônoma de workflows com Claude Code","Criação de projetos com nomes de branch personalizados","Suporte a descrições de recursos e histórias de usuário","Geração de arquivos prd.json para uso em projetos"],"ru":["Преобразование PRD в формат prd.json","Автономное выполнение рабочих процессов с ИИ Агентами и Claude Code","Создание проектов с настраиваемыми именами веток","Поддержка описаний функций и историй пользователя","Генерация файлов prd.json для использования в проектах"],"ar":["تحويل PRD إلى تنسيق prd.json","التشغيل الآلي للعمليات التشغيلية باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي و Claude Code","إنشاء مشاريع بأسماء فروع مخصصة","دعم وصفات الميزات وقصص المستخدم","توليد ملفات prd.json للاستخدام في المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ralph","what is ralph","ralph alternative","ralph vs claude code","ralph install","ralph setup guide","automated app building","prd.json format","claude code integration"],"zh":["Ralph","自动化工作流","PRD 转换","JSON 格式","Claude Code","自动化构建","应用程序开发","Markdown 文件","自动化工具"],"ja":["Ralph","自動化ワークフロー","PRD 変換","JSON フォーマット","Claude Code","自動構築","アプリケーション開発","Markdown ファイル","自動化ツール"],"ko":["Ralph","자동화 워크플로우","PRD 변환","JSON 형식","Claude Code","자동 빌드","애플리케이션 개발","Markdown 파일","자동화 도구"],"es":["Ralph","agente de IA","herramienta de desarrollo","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","flujo de trabajo automatizado","desarrollo de aplicaciones","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["Ralph","agent IA","outil de développement","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","flux de travail automatisé","développement d''applications","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Ralph","IA-Agent","Entwicklungstool","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","automatisierter Workflow","Anwendungsentwicklung","Aufgabenautomatisierung"],"pt":["Ralph","automação de workflows","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ferramentas de automação","execução autônoma"],"ru":["Ralph","автономная разработка приложений","ИИ Агенты","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","разработка приложений","инструменты для автономного выполнения","автономное выполнение рабочих процессов"],"ar":["Ralph","تحسين العمليات التشغيلية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","Claude Code","PRD","prd.json","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات التشغيل الآلي","التشغيل الآلي للعمليات التشغيلية"]}},"owner":"rohunj","repo":"claude-build-workflow","repoPath":"rohunj/claude-build-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Convert PRDs to prd.json format for the Ralph autonomous agent system. Use when you have an existing PRD and need to convert it to Ralphs JSON format. Triggers on: convert this prd, turn this into ralph format, create prd.json from this, ralph json.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As","body":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Criterion 1\",\n        \"Criterion 2\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Story Size: The Number One Rule\n\n**Each story must be completable in ONE Ralph iteration (one context window).**\n\nRalph spawns a fresh Amp instance per iteration with no memory of previous work. If a story is too big, the LLM runs out of context before finishing and produces broken code.\n\n### Right-sized stories:\n- Add a database column and migration\n- Add a UI component to an existing page\n- Update a server action with new logic\n- Add a filter dropdown to a list\n\n### Too big (split these):\n- \"Build the entire dashboard\" - Split into: schema, queries, UI components, filters\n- \"Add authentication\" - Split into: schema, middleware, login UI, session handling\n- \"Refactor the API\" - Split into one story per endpoint or pattern\n\n**Rule of thumb:** If you cannot describe the change in 2-3 sentences, it is too big.\n\n---\n\n## Story Ordering: Dependencies First\n\nStories execute in priority order. Earlier stories must not depend on later ones.\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes (migrations)\n2. Server actions / backend logic\n3. UI components that use the backend\n4. Dashboard/summary views that aggregate data\n\n**Wrong order:**\n1. UI component (depends on schema that does not exist yet)\n2. Schema change\n\n---\n\n## Acceptance Criteria: Must Be Verifiable\n\nEach criterion must be something Ralph can CHECK, not something vague.\n\n### Good criteria (verifiable):\n- \"Add `status` column to tasks table with default ''pending''\"\n- \"Filter dropdown has options: All, Active, Completed\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog\"\n- \"Typecheck passes\"\n- \"Tests pass\"\n\n### Bad criteria (vague):\n- \"Works correctly\"\n- \"User can do X easily\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"Handles edge cases\"\n\n### Always include as final criterion:\n```\n\"Typecheck passes\"\n```\n\nFor stories with testable logic, also include:\n```\n\"Tests pass\"\n```\n\n### For stories that change UI, also include:\n```\n\"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n```\n\nFrontend stories are NOT complete until visually verified. Ralph will use the dev-browser skill to navigate to the page, interact with the UI, and confirm changes work.\n\n---\n\n## Conversion Rules\n\n1. **Each user story becomes one JSON entry**\n2. **IDs**: Sequential (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n3. **Priority**: Based on dependency order, then document order\n4. **All stories**: `passes: false` and empty `notes`\n5. **branchName**: Derive from feature name, kebab-case, prefixed with `ralph/`\n6. **Always add**: \"Typecheck passes\" to every story''s acceptance criteria\n\n---\n\n## Splitting Large PRDs\n\nIf a PRD has big features, split them:\n\n**Original:**\n> \"Add user notification system\"\n\n**Split into:**\n1. US-001: Add notifications table to database\n2. US-002: Create notification service for sending notifications\n3. US-003: Add notification bell icon to header\n4. US-004: Create notification dropdown panel\n5. US-005: Add mark-as-read functionality\n6. US-006: Add notification preferences page\n\nEach is one focused change that can be completed and verified independently.\n\n---\n\n## Example\n\n**Input PRD:**\n```markdown\n# Task Status Feature\n\nAdd ability to mark tasks with different statuses.\n\n## Requirements\n- Toggle between pending/in-progress/done on task list\n- Filter list by status\n- Show status badge on each task\n- Persist status in database\n```\n\n**Output prd.json:**\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"TaskApp\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/task-status\",\n  \"description\": \"Task Status Feature - Track task progress with status indicators\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status field to tasks table\",\n      \"description\": \"As a developer, I need to store task status in the database.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Add status column: ''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'' (default ''pending'')\",\n        \"Generate and run migration successfully\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Display status badge on task cards\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to see task status at a glance.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each task card shows colored status badge\",\n        \"Badge colors: gray=pending, blue=in_progress, green=done\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status toggle to task list rows\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to change task status directly from the list.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each row has status dropdown or toggle\",\n        \"Changing status saves immediately\",\n        \"UI updates without page refresh\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Filter tasks by status\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to filter the list to see only certain statuses.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter dropdown: All | Pending | In Progress | Done\",\n        \"Filter persists in URL params\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Archiving Previous Runs\n\n**Before writing a new prd.json, check if there is an existing one from a different feature:**\n\n1. Read the current `prd.json` if it exists\n2. Check if `branchName` differs from the new feature''s branch name\n3. If different AND `progress.txt` has content beyond the header:\n   - Create archive folder: `archive/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-name/`\n   - Copy current `prd.json` and `progress.txt` to archive\n   - Reset `progress.txt` with fresh header\n\n**The ralph.sh script handles this automatically** when you run it, but if you are manually updating prd.json between runs, archive first.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Saving\n\nBefore writing prd.json, verify:\n\n- [ ] **Previous run archived** (if prd.json exists with different branchName, archive it first!)\n- [ ] **ALL stories have `passes: false`** (CRITICAL - never copy old pass status!)\n- [ ] Each story is completable in one iteration (small enough)\n- [ ] Stories are ordered by dependency (schema to backend to UI)\n- [ ] Every story has \"Typecheck passes\" as criterion\n- [ ] UI stories have \"Verify in browser\" as criterion\n- [ ] Acceptance criteria are verifiable (not vague)\n- [ ] No story depends on a later story\n\n## CRITICAL: Always Reset passes to false\n\nWhen creating a new prd.json, **ALWAYS** set `passes: false` for every story. Never:\n- Copy pass status from an old prd.json\n- Leave stories marked as `passes: true`\n- Assume previous work carries over\n\nEach new prd.json is a fresh start. The Ralph loop will mark stories as `passes: true` only after successfully implementing them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:43.166Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents utilizing Claude Code, seeking to automate app building workflows with PRD conversion capabilities.","zh":"适用于使用 Claude Code 的开发代理，旨在自动化带有 PRD 转换功能的应用构建工作流程。","ja":"Claude Code を使用する開発エージェントに適しており、PRD 変換機能を備えたアプリビルドのワークフローを自動化することを目的としています。","ko":"Claude Code를 사용하는 개발 에이전트에 적합하며 PRD 변환 기능을 갖춘 애플리케이션 빌드 워크플로를 자동화하는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que utilizan Claude Code, que buscan automatizar flujos de trabajo de creación de aplicaciones con capacidades de conversión de PRD.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement utilisant Claude Code, cherchant à automatiser les flux de travail de création d''applications avec des capacités de conversion de PRD.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die Claude Code nutzen, um Arbeitsabläufe für die Erstellung von Apps mit PRD-Konvertierungsfunktionen zu automatisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que utilizam Claude Code, buscando automatizar fluxos de trabalho de construção de aplicativos com capacidades de conversão de PRD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, использующих Claude Code, стремящихся автоматизировать рабочие процессы построения приложений с возможностями преобразования PRD.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يستخدمون Claude Code، ويسعون إلى تلقين عمليات بناء التطبيقات معقدرات تحويل PRD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PRDs to prd.json format, enabling autonomous execution and streamlined development processes with markdown files and text inputs, leveraging JSON output for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理将 PRD 转换为 prd.json 格式的能力，使得自动执行和开发流程简化，并支持 markdown 文件和文本输入，利用 JSON 输出实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに PRD を prd.json 形式に変換する能力を提供し、自動実行と開発プロセスの簡素化を可能にし、Markdown ファイルとテキスト入力をサポートし、JSON 出力を使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 PRD를 prd.json 형식으로 변환하는 능력을 부여하여 자동 실행과 개발 프로세스를 단순화하며, 마크다운 파일과 텍스트 입력을 지원하고 JSON 출력을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir PRDs al formato prd.json, permitiendo la ejecución autónoma y los procesos de desarrollo optimizados con archivos markdown y entradas de texto, aprovechando la salida JSON para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir les PRD au format prd.json, permettant l''exécution autonome et les processus de développement rationalisés avec des fichiers markdown et des entrées de texte, en exploitant la sortie JSON pour une intégration sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, PRDs in das prd.json-Format umzuwandeln, wodurch eine autonome Ausführung und optimierte Entwicklungsprozesse mit Markdown-Dateien und Texteingaben ermöglicht werden, wobei die JSON-Ausgabe für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter PRDs para formato prd.json, permitindo a execução autônoma e processos de desenvolvimento otimizados com arquivos markdown e entradas de texto, aproveitando a saída JSON para integração sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать PRD в формат prd.json, что позволяет обеспечить автономное выполнение и оптимизированные процессы разработки с файлами markdown и текстовыми входами, используя выходные данные JSON для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل PRDs إلى تنسيق prd.json، مما يتيح التنفيذ الذاتي وعمليات التطوير المنسقة مع ملفات markdown والمدخلات النصية، واستخدام مخرجات JSON للاندماج السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting PRDs to prd.json for autonomous app building","Automating workflow execution with Claude Code","Generating prd.json files from markdown or text-based PRDs"],"zh":["将 PRD 转换为 prd.json 格式以实现自主应用构建","使用 Claude Code 自动执行工作流程","从 markdown 或基于文本的 PRD 生成 prd.json 文件"],"ja":["PRD を prd.json 形式に変換して自動アプリビルドを実現する","Claude Code を使用してワークフローの自動実行を実現する","Markdown またはテキストベースの PRD から prd.json ファイルを生成する"],"ko":["PRD를 prd.json 형식으로 변환하여 자율적인 애플리케이션 빌드를实现하는こと","Claude Code를 사용하여 워크플로우 자동 실행을 구현하는 것","마크다운이나 텍스트 기반의 PRD에서 prd.json 파일을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de PRDs a prd.json para la creación autónoma de aplicaciones","Automatización de la ejecución de flujos de trabajo con Claude Code","Generación de archivos prd.json a partir de PRDs basados en markdown o texto"],"fr":["Conversion de PRD en prd.json pour la création d''applications autonome","Automatisation de l''exécution de flux de travail avec Claude Code","Génération de fichiers prd.json à partir de PRD basés sur markdown ou texte"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRDs in prd.json für die autonome App-Erstellung","Automatisierung der Ausführung von Arbeitsabläufen mit Claude Code","Erzeugung von prd.json-Dateien aus markdown- oder textbasierten PRDs"],"pt":["Conversão de PRDs para prd.json para construção autônoma de aplicativos","Automatização da execução do fluxo de trabalho com Claude Code","Geração de arquivos prd.json a partir de PRDs baseados em markdown ou texto"],"ru":["Преобразование PRD в формат prd.json для автономного построения приложений","Автоматизация выполнения рабочего процесса с помощью Claude Code","Генерация файлов prd.json из PRD на основе markdown или текста"],"ar":["تحويل PRDs إلى تنسيق prd.json لإنشاء تطبيقات ذاتية","تلقين تنفيذ عمليات العمل مع Claude Code","توليد ملفات prd.json من PRDs القائمة على markdown أو النص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code compatibility","Input limited to markdown files or text-based PRDs","Output specific to prd.json format"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 兼容性","输入仅限于 markdown 文件或基于文本的 PRD","输出特定于 prd.json 格式"],"ja":["Claude Code の互換性が必要","入力は Markdown ファイルまたはテキストベースの PRD に限定される","出力は prd.json 形式に特化している"],"ko":["Claude Code 호환성이 필요","입력은 마크다운 파일 또는 텍스트 기반의 PRD로 제한됨","출력은 prd.json 형식에 특화됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude Code","Entrada limitada a archivos markdown o PRDs basados en texto","Salida específica del formato prd.json"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Claude Code","Entrée limitée aux fichiers markdown ou PRD basés sur le texte","Sortie spécifique au format prd.json"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Eingabe beschränkt auf Markdown-Dateien oder textbasierte PRDs","Ausgabe spezifisch für das prd.json-Format"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Claude Code","Entrada limitada a arquivos markdown ou PRDs baseados em texto","Saída específica para formato prd.json"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Claude Code","Вход ограничен файлами markdown или текстовыми PRD","Выход специфичен для формата prd.json"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Claude Code","المدخلات مقيدة بملفات markdown أو PRDs القائمة على النص","المخرجات محددة لتنسيق prd.json"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a6a8733abaee5b370957ebd6745a56db88712697fc1262f388d2438b6bbcc021","qualityScore":60}');
