érence au processus de traduction des conceptions Figma en code de production prêt","de":"Design implementieren bezeichnet den Prozess der Übersetzung von Figma-Designs in produktionssreifen Code","pt":"O que é Implement Design? É uma habilidade que fornece um fluxo de trabalho para traduzir designs do Figma em código de produção.","ru":"Что такое реализация дизайна? Это навык, обеспечивающий рабочий процесс для перевода дизайнов Figma в код производства.","ar":"ما هي أداة التصميم؟ هي مهارة توفر تدفق عمل لترجمة تصاميم Figma إلى كود الإنتاج"},"features":{"en":["Connects to the Figma MCP server for design data access","Utilizes design tokens for consistent design implementation","Ensures 1:1 visual parity with Figma designs","Verifies Figma MCP server connection using tools like get_design_context","Provides a structured workflow for design implementation"],"zh":["使用Figma MCP服务器实现设计自动化","确保与设计的1：1视觉一致性","支持设计tokens的使用","提供get_design_context等Figma MCP工具"],"ja":["Figma MCPサーバーを使用してデザインの自動化を実現","デザインとの1：1視覺一致性を確保","デザイントークンの使用をサポート","get_design_context等のFigma MCPツールを提供"],"ko":["피그마 MCP 서버를 사용하여 디자인 자동화를 구현","디자인과의 1:1視覺 일치를 달성","디자인 토큰의 사용을 지원","get_design_context 등 피그마 MCP 툴을 제공"],"es":["Integración consistente con el servidor Figma MCP","Uso adecuado de tokens de diseño","Paridad visual 1:1 con los diseños","Flujo de trabajo estructurado para la implementación de diseños","Conexión al servidor Figma MCP para verificar la disponibilidad de herramientas"],"fr":["Intégration cohérente avec le serveur Figma MCP","Utilisation appropriée des jetons de conception","Parité visuelle 1:1 avec les conceptions","Flux de travail structuré pour la mise en œuvre des conceptions","Connexion au serveur Figma MCP pour vérifier la disponibilité des outils"],"de":["Konsistente Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server","Geeignete Verwendung von Designtokens","Visuelle Parität 1:1 mit den Designs","Strukturierter Workflow für die Implementierung von Designs","Verbindung zum Figma-MCP-Server zur Überprüfung der Verfügbarkeit von Tools"],"pt":["Integração com o servidor Figma MCP","Uso de tokens de design para garantir consistência","Paridade visual 1:1 com os designs","Fluxo de trabalho estruturado para traduzir designs em código","Verificação de conexão com o servidor Figma MCP"],"ru":["Интеграция с сервером Figma MCP","Использование токенов дизайна для обеспечения согласованности","Визуальная паритет 1:1 с дизайнами","Структурированный рабочий процесс для перевода дизайнов в код","Проверка подключения к серверу Figma MCP"],"ar":["التكامل مع خادم Figma MCP","استخدام رموز التصميم لضمان الاتساق","الموافقة البصرية 1:1 مع التصاميم","تدفق عمل منظم لترجمة التصاميم إلى كود","فحص الاتصال بخادم Figma MCP"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use implement-design","implement-design Figma MCP server integration","what is implement-design","implement-design alternative","implement-design setup guide","Figma MCP server tutorial"],"zh":["Figma MCP服务器","设计自动化","AIエージェント","设计tokens","get_design_context","视觉一致性","Implement Design","Figma MCP工具"],"ja":["Figma MCPサーバー","デザインの自動化","AIエージェント","デザイントークン","get_design_context","視覚的一致性","Implement Design","Figma MCPツール"],"ko":["피그마 MCP 서버","디자인 자동화","AI 에이전트","디자인 토큰","get_design_context","시각적 일치","Implement Design","피그마 MCP 툴"],"es":["implementar diseño","Figma MCP","tokens de diseño","paridad visual","flujo de trabajo de diseño","conexión al servidor Figma MCP","herramientas de diseño","desarrollo de software","diseño de UX","diseño de UI"],"fr":["mettre en œuvre la conception","Figma MCP","jetons de conception","parité visuelle","flux de travail de conception","connexion au serveur Figma MCP","outils de conception","développement de logiciels","conception UX","conception UI"],"de":["Design implementieren","Figma MCP","Designtokens","visuelle Parität","Design-Workflow","Verbindung zum Figma-MCP-Server","Designtools","Software-Entwicklung","UX-Design","UI-Design"],"pt":["implement design","figma mcp","design tokens","paridade visual","fluxo de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de design"],"ru":["реализация дизайна","figma mcp","токены дизайна","визуальная паритет","рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты дизайна"],"ar":["أداة التصميم","خادم Figma MCP","رموز التصميم","الموافقة البصرية","تدفق العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التصميم"]}},"owner":"figma","repo":"mcp-server-guide","repoPath":"figma/mcp-server-guide","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.285Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-design","description":"Translates Figma designs into production-ready code with 1:1 visual fidelity. Use when implementing UI from Figma files, when user mentions implement design, generate code, implement component, build Figma design, provides Figma URLs, or asks to build components matching Figma specs. Requires Figma MCP server connection.","bodyPreview":"# Implement Design\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for translating Figma designs into production-ready code with pixel-perfect accuracy. It ensures consistent integration with the Figma MCP server, proper use of design tokens, and 1:1 visual parity with designs.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Figma MCP server must be connected and accessible\n  - Before proceeding, verify the Figma MCP server is connected by checking if Figma MCP tools (e.g., `get_design_context`) are available.\n  -","body":"# Implement Design\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for translating Figma designs into production-ready code with pixel-perfect accuracy. It ensures consistent integration with the Figma MCP server, proper use of design tokens, and 1:1 visual parity with designs.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Figma MCP server must be connected and accessible\n  - Before proceeding, verify the Figma MCP server is connected by checking if Figma MCP tools (e.g., `get_design_context`) are available.\n  - If the tools are not available, the Figma MCP server may not be enabled. Guide the user to enable the Figma MCP server that is included with the plugin. They may need to restart their MCP client afterward.\n- User must provide a Figma URL in the format: `https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2`\n  - `:fileKey` is the file key\n  - `1-2` is the node ID (the specific component or frame to implement)\n- Project should have an established design system or component library (preferred)\n\n## Required Workflow\n\n**Follow these steps in order. Do not skip steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Get Node ID\n\n#### Option A: Parse from Figma URL\n\nWhen the user provides a Figma URL, extract the file key and node ID to pass as arguments to MCP tools.\n\n**URL format:** `https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2`\n\n**Extract:**\n\n- **File key:** `:fileKey` (the segment after `/design/`)\n- **Node ID:** `1-2` (the value of the `node-id` query parameter)\n\n**Example:**\n\n- URL: `https://figma.com/design/kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF/DesignSystem?node-id=42-15`\n- File key: `kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF`\n- Node ID: `42-15`\n\n### Step 2: Fetch Design Context\n\nRun `get_design_context` with the extracted file key and node ID.\n\n```\nget_design_context(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")\n```\n\nThis provides the structured data including:\n\n- Layout properties (Auto Layout, constraints, sizing)\n- Typography specifications\n- Color values and design tokens\n- Component structure and variants\n- Spacing and padding values\n\n**If the response is too large or truncated:**\n\n1. Run `get_metadata(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")` to get the high-level node map\n2. Identify the specific child nodes needed from the metadata\n3. Fetch individual child nodes with `get_design_context(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\":childNodeId\")`\n\n### Step 3: Capture Visual Reference\n\nRun `get_screenshot` with the same file key and node ID for a visual reference.\n\n```\nget_screenshot(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")\n```\n\nThis screenshot serves as the source of truth for visual validation. Keep it accessible throughout implementation.\n\n### Step 4: Download Required Assets\n\nDownload any assets (images, icons, SVGs) returned by the Figma MCP server.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Follow these asset rules:\n\n- If the Figma MCP server returns a `localhost` source for an image or SVG, use that source directly\n- DO NOT import or add new icon packages - all assets should come from the Figma payload\n- DO NOT use or create placeholders if a `localhost` source is provided\n- Assets are served through the Figma MCP server''s built-in assets endpoint\n\n### Step 5: Translate to Project Conventions\n\nTranslate the Figma output into this project''s framework, styles, and conventions.\n\n**Key principles:**\n\n- Treat the Figma MCP output (typically React + Tailwind) as a representation of design and behavior, not as final code style\n- Replace Tailwind utility classes with the project''s preferred utilities or design system tokens\n- Reuse existing components (buttons, inputs, typography, icon wrappers) instead of duplicating functionality\n- Use the project''s color system, typography scale, and spacing tokens consistently\n- Respect existing routing, state management, and data-fetch patterns\n\n### Step 6: Achieve 1:1 Visual Parity\n\nStrive for pixel-perfect visual parity with the Figma design.\n\n**Guidelines:**\n\n- Prioritize Figma fidelity to match designs exactly\n- Avoid hardcoded values - use design tokens from Figma where available\n- When conflicts arise between design system tokens and Figma specs, prefer design system tokens but adjust spacing or sizes minimally to match visuals\n- Follow WCAG requirements for accessibility\n- Add component documentation as needed\n\n### Step 7: Validate Against Figma\n\nBefore marking complete, validate the final UI against the Figma screenshot.\n\n**Validation checklist:**\n\n- [ ] Layout matches (spacing, alignment, sizing)\n- [ ] Typography matches (font, size, weight, line height)\n- [ ] Colors match exactly\n- [ ] Interactive states work as designed (hover, active, disabled)\n- [ ] Responsive behavior follows Figma constraints\n- [ ] Assets render correctly\n- [ ] Accessibility standards met\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### Component Organization\n\n- Place UI components in the project''s designated design system directory\n- Follow the project''s component naming conventions\n- Avoid inline styles unless truly necessary for dynamic values\n\n### Design System Integration\n\n- ALWAYS use components from the project''s design system when possible\n- Map Figma design tokens to project design tokens\n- When a matching component exists, extend it rather than creating a new one\n- Document any new components added to the design system\n\n### Code Quality\n\n- Avoid hardcoded values - extract to constants or design tokens\n- Keep components composable and reusable\n- Add TypeScript types for component props\n- Include JSDoc comments for exported components\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Implementing a Button Component\n\nUser says: \"Implement this Figma button component: https://figma.com/design/kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF/DesignSystem?node-id=42-15\"\n\n**Actions:**\n\n1. Parse URL to extract fileKey=`kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF` and nodeId=`42-15`\n2. Run `get_design_context(fileKey=\"kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF\", nodeId=\"42-15\")`\n3. Run `get_screenshot(fileKey=\"kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF\", nodeId=\"42-15\")` for visual reference\n4. Download any button icons from the assets endpoint\n5. Check if project has existing button component\n6. If yes, extend it with new variant; if no, create new component using project conventions\n7. Map Figma colors to project design tokens (e.g., `primary-500`, `primary-hover`)\n8. Validate against screenshot for padding, border radius, typography\n\n**Result:** Button component matching Figma design, integrated with project design system.\n\n### Example 2: Building a Dashboard Layout\n\nUser says: \"Build this dashboard: https://figma.com/design/pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D/Dashboard?node-id=10-5\"\n\n**Actions:**\n\n1. Parse URL to extract fileKey=`pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D` and nodeId=`10-5`\n2. Run `get_metadata(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\"10-5\")` to understand the page structure\n3. Identify main sections from metadata (header, sidebar, content area, cards) and their child node IDs\n4. Run `get_design_context(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\":childNodeId\")` for each major section\n5. Run `get_screenshot(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\"10-5\")` for the full page\n6. Download all assets (logos, icons, charts)\n7. Build layout using project''s layout primitives\n8. Implement each section using existing components where possible\n9. Validate responsive behavior against Figma constraints\n\n**Result:** Complete dashboard matching Figma design with responsive layout.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Always Start with Context\n\nNever implement based on assumptions. Always fetch `get_design_context` and `get_screenshot` first.\n\n### Incremental Validation\n\nValidate frequently during implementation, not just at the end. This catches issues early.\n\n### Document Deviations\n\nIf you must deviate from the Figma design (e.g., for accessibility or technical constraints), document why in code comments.\n\n### Reuse Over Recreation\n\nAlways check for existing components before creating new ones. Consistency across the codebase is more important than exact Figma replication.\n\n### Design System First\n\nWhen in doubt, prefer the project''s design system patterns over literal Figma translation.\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue: Figma output is truncated\n\n**Cause:** The design is too complex or has too many nested layers to return in a single response.\n**Solution:** Use `get_metadata` to get the node structure, then fetch specific nodes individually with `get_design_context`.\n\n### Issue: Design doesn''t match after implementation\n\n**Cause:** Visual discrepancies between the implemented code and the original Figma design.\n**Solution:** Compare side-by-side with the screenshot from Step 3. Check spacing, colors, and typography values in the design context data.\n\n### Issue: Assets not loading\n\n**Cause:** The Figma MCP server''s assets endpoint is not accessible or the URLs are being modified.\n**Solution:** Verify the Figma MCP server''s assets endpoint is accessible. The server serves assets at `localhost` URLs. Use these directly without modification.\n\n### Issue: Design token values differ from Figma\n\n**Cause:** The project''s design system tokens have different values than those specified in the Figma design.\n**Solution:** When project tokens differ from Figma values, prefer project tokens for consistency but adjust spacing/sizing to maintain visual fidelity.\n\n## Understanding Design Implementation\n\nThe Figma implementation workflow establishes a reliable process for translating designs to code:\n\n**For designers:** Confidence that implementations will match their designs with pixel-perfect accuracy.\n**For developers:** A structured approach that eliminates guesswork and reduces back-and-forth revisions.\n**For teams:** Consistent, high-quality implementations that maintain design system integrity.\n\nBy following this workflow, you ensure that every Figma design is implemented with the same level of care and attention to detail.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [Figma MCP Server Documentation](https://developers.figma.com/docs/figma-mcp-server/)\n- [Figma MCP Server Tools and Prompts](https://developers.figma.com/docs/figma-mcp-server/tools-and-prompts/)\n- [Figma Variables and Design Tokens](https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/15339657135383-Guide-to-variables-in-Figma)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:58.063Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring precise Figma design implementation and pixel-perfect code generation.","zh":"适用于需要精确 Figma 设计实现和像素级代码生成的前端代理。","ja":"Figma 設計の正確な実装とピクセルパーフェクトなコード生成を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適。","ko":"정확한 Figma 디자인 구현과 픽셀 完전한 코드 생성이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren una implementación de diseño de Figma precisa y generación de código perfecta en píxeles.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une mise en œuvre de conception Figma précise et une génération de code parfaite en pixels.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine präzise Figma-Designimplementierung und eine pixelgenaue Codegenerierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem implementação de design preciso do Figma e geração de código perfeita em termos de pixels.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, требующих точной реализации дизайна Figma и генерации кода с точностью до пикселя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يتطلب تنفيذا دقيقا لتصميم الفيغما وتوليد رمز دقيق فيما يتعلق بالبكسل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate Figma designs into production-ready code with pixel-perfect accuracy, ensuring consistent integration with the Figma MCP server and proper use of design tokens via protocols like Figma MCP tools.","zh":"赋予代理将 Figma 设计转换为生产就绪代码的能力，确保与 Figma MCP 服务器的一致集成和通过协议如 Figma MCP 工具正确使用设计令牌。","ja":"Figma 設計を生産就緒のコードに翻訳するエージェントを可能にし、Figma MCP サーバーとの一貫した統合と、Figma MCP ツールなどのプロトコルを介したデザイン トークンの適切な使用を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Figma 디자인을 생산 준비 코드로 번역할 수 있도록 하며, Figma MCP 서버와의 일관된 통합 및 Figma MCP 도구와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 디자인 토큰의 적절한 사용을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir diseños de Figma en código listo para producción con precisión de píxel perfecta, garantizando una integración coherente con el servidor Figma MCP y un uso adecuado de tokens de diseño a través de protocolos como las herramientas Figma MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire les conceptions Figma en code prêt pour la production avec une précision parfaite en pixels, en garantissant une intégration cohérente avec le serveur Figma MCP et une utilisation appropriée des jetons de conception via des protocoles tels que les outils Figma MCP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Figma-Entwürfe in produktionssicheren Code mit pixelgenauer Genauigkeit zu übersetzen, wodurch eine konsistente Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server und eine ordnungsgemäße Verwendung von Designtoken über Protokolle wie Figma-MCP-Tools sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir designs do Figma em código pronto para produção com precisão perfeita em termos de pixels, garantindo integração consistente com o servidor Figma MCP e uso adequado de tokens de design por meio de protocolos como as ferramentas Figma MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить дизайны Figma в код, готовый к производству, с точностью до пикселя, обеспечивая последовательную интеграцию с сервером Figma MCP и правильное использование токенов дизайна через протоколы, такие как инструменты Figma MCP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ترجمة تصاميم الفيغما إلى رمز جاهز للإنتاج بدقة مثالية فيما يتعلق بالبكسل، مما يضمن التكامل الثابت مع خادم الفيغما MCP والاستخدام المناسب للرموز التصميمية من خلال بروتوكولات مثل أدوات الفيغما MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating Figma designs into production-ready code","Ensuring 1:1 visual parity with Figma designs","Integrating with Figma MCP server for design context"],"zh":["将 Figma 设计转换为生产就绪代码","确保与 Figma 设计的 1:1 视觉一致性","与 Figma MCP 服务器集成以获取设计上下文"],"ja":["Figma 設計を生産就緒のコードに翻訳する","Figma 設計との 1:1 の視覚的一致性を確保する","Figma MCP サーバーと統合してデザイン コンテキストを取得する"],"ko":["Figma 디자인을 생산 준비 코드로 번역하는 것","Figma 디자인과의 1:1 시각적 일관성을 보장하는 것","Figma MCP 서버와의 통합을 통해 디자인 컨텍스트를 얻는 것"],"es":["Traducir diseños de Figma en código listo para producción","Garantizar la paridad visual 1:1 con los diseños de Figma","Integrarse con el servidor Figma MCP para el contexto de diseño"],"fr":["Traduire les conceptions Figma en code prêt pour la production","Assurer une parité visuelle 1:1 avec les conceptions Figma","Intégrer avec le serveur Figma MCP pour le contexte de conception"],"de":["Figma-Entwürfe in produktionssicheren Code übersetzen","1:1 visuelle Parität mit Figma-Entwürfen sicherstellen","Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server für den Designkontext"],"pt":["Traduzir designs do Figma em código pronto para produção","Garantir paridade visual 1:1 com designs do Figma","Integrar com o servidor Figma MCP para contexto de design"],"ru":["Переводить дизайны Figma в код, готовый к производству","Обеспечивать визуальную паритет 1:1 с дизайнами Figma","Интегрировать с сервером Figma MCP для контекста дизайна"],"ar":["ترجمة تصاميم الفيغما إلى رمز جاهز للإنتاج","ضمان التكافؤ المرئي 1:1 مع تصاميم الفيغما","التكامل مع خادم الفيغما MCP للحصول على سياق التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires connected and accessible Figma MCP server","Dependent on availability of Figma MCP tools like get_design_context"],"zh":["需要连接和可访问的 Figma MCP 服务器","依赖于 Figma MCP 工具（如 get_design_context） 的可用性"],"ja":["接続された Figma MCP サーバーとアクセス可能なサーバーが必要","Figma MCP ツール（たとえば get_design_context） の可用性に依存する"],"ko":["연결된 Figma MCP 서버와 접근 가능한 서버가 필요합니다","Figma MCP 도구(get_design_context 등)의 가용성에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere un servidor Figma MCP conectado y accesible","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de herramientas Figma MCP como get_design_context"],"fr":["Nécessite un serveur Figma MCP connecté et accessible","Dépend de la disponibilité d''outils Figma MCP tels que get_design_context"],"de":["Benötigt einen verbundenen und zugänglichen Figma-MCP-Server","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von Figma-MCP-Tools wie get_design_context"],"pt":["Requer servidor Figma MCP conectado e acessível","Dependente da disponibilidade de ferramentas Figma MCP como get_design_context"],"ru":["Требует подключенного и доступного сервера Figma MCP","Зависит от наличия инструментов Figma MCP, таких как get_design_context"],"ar":["يتطلب خادم الفيغما MCP متصلاً وقابلاً للوصول","يعتمد على توافر أدوات الفيغما MCP مثل get_design_context"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8eed282f173196053d3864a69c7fb6d02ea3fc3ad990f1349feba04919f5ccb6","qualityScore":60}');
